    "body": "**macOS check (Apple Silicon, M5 Mac) at da334d12, as the review asked:**\n- `cargo test -p xtask`: 13 passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate batch --dry-run`: 9 steps, every one ok:\n  - geometry, cl, tools, post, sim, motion and app suites; ui runs from `crates/ui`; then clippy `-D warnings` over all eight crates.\n  - The motion list leaves out `finish3d`, `flow` and `pivot5d`, and the app list leaves out `center_cut_multiaxis`, as `SLOW_BINARIES` says.\n- `cargo xtask gate release --dry-run`: 13 steps ok, adding the motion and app `--ignored` heavy lanes and the ui snapshot lane (debug `--ignored`, cwd `crates/ui`).\n- `gate-logs/` is gitignored (`.gitignore:12`), so a run leaves the tree clean.\nNot run: a real (non-dry) gate on macOS, and Linux.",
